  headerText: Prepare the mixer
  contentText: Place a <b>cup</b> under the <b>mixer</b> again by clicking <b>LMB</b>
    on the <b>cup stack</b> left of the <b>mixer</b>. If a <b>cup</b> is already
    there, <b>trash it</b> and place it again.
